When you are in a a desecrated and deserted temple, for every move you
take you have a one in five chance of getting one of three messages:
  - you have an eerie feeling...
  - you feel like you are being watched.
  - A shiver runs down your spine.

When you get one of these messages, there is a one in five chance that
a ghost will appear. (ie: a 1/25 chance for every move you make in 
such a temple).

The simple way prevent more ghosts from appearing is to leave the
temple.

The "mailman" appears everytime someone sends you mail (if your system
is set up properly).
